WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.819
Use this guide to decide what kind of action the
evidence supports A known

00:00:05.845 --> 00:00:11.509
formatting difference can be standardized A
documented blank-as-missing

00:00:11.535 --> 00:00:17.142
convention can be normalized An invalid value with
unknown truth should

00:00:17.155 --> 00:00:23.291
be flagged or quarantined Possible duplicates need
detection and resolution

00:00:23.317 --> 00:00:30.059
logic A supported correction can be applied safely
And

00:00:30.085 --> 00:00:33.335
stable rules can become constraints for future
prevention
